# backend/ is a Modal-deployed, GPU-only service (Evo2 inference) -- it
# cannot run on Vercel (no GPU on Vercel's Python runtime, and
# backend/main.py exports a modal.App, not a FastAPI/ASGI app Vercel
# could serve anyway). Excluded so Vercel's multi-service import
# detection never proposes deploying it. Deploy it separately with
# `modal deploy backend/main.py` -- see CONTRIBUTING.md.
backend/
